{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"TroopRally API","version":"1.4.0","description":"Read and manage rallies, slots, bookings, and poll responses. Generate a key under Settings → Integrations (Pro plan required) and see https://trooprally.com/integrations for authentication details and examples. Each key is rate-limited to 300 requests per 60-second window; exceeding it returns 429 with a Retry-After header (see TooManyRequests). What changed in 1.4.0: the Group Poll confirmation endpoints no longer take a note. A request with a non-empty note is refused with 400; put anything respondents should know in the poll's onlineMeetingDetails, which the confirmation emails include. What changed in 1.3.0: reminder emails. Every rally gains reminderOffsetsMinutes (when, before a booked time, attendees get a reminder email). Creating a Registration Sheet or Booking Agent turns them on at 1 day before unless the request says otherwise, and confirming or changing a Group Poll's time can set them for everyone who said yes or maybe. What changed in 1.2.0: confirming a Group Poll's time can also add it to the organizer's own calendar (addToCalendar, on by default), and a later change or cancellation moves or removes that event. What changed in 1.1.0: a Group Poll's final time can be confirmed, changed, or canceled with POST/PUT/DELETE /v1/rallies/group-polls/{id}/confirmation. A rally's status can now be \"confirmed\" (a Group Poll with a confirmed time; voting is closed) -- clients that switch on status should handle it. Every rally gains confirmedSlot and confirmedAt."},"servers":[{"url":"https://api.trooprally.com"}],"security":[{"apiKeyAuth":[]}],"components":{"securitySchemes":{"apiKeyAuth":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","description":"A general-purpose key generated under Settings → Integrations, scoped to specific routes, sent as an Authorization: Bearer header. Each operation below lists the scope it requires in its x-required-scopes extension (this scheme is http/bearer, not oauth2, so the standard per-operation security scopes array has no meaning here and is always empty).\n\n**Example**\n```bash\ncurl https://api.trooprally.com/v1/rallies \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer tr_live_51H8fK2mQxN7vR9pL3wZaYcTgHsJdEuBn\"\n```\nA missing or invalid key returns `401` (see Unauthorized below)."}},"schemas":{"Rally":{"type":"object","description":"Fields common to every rally type -- what GET /v1/rallies (the list) returns. Getting a rally's type-specific fields (hideParticipantNames, bookingAgent, etc.) requires its own type -- see GroupPollRally, RegistrationSheetRally, and BookingAgentRally, returned by GET/POST /v1/rallies/group-polls|registration-sheets|booking-agents/...","required":["rallyId","rallyShareCode","rallyTitle","rallyType","meetingFormat","status","createdAt","closedAt","confirmedSlot","confirmedAt","description","location","onlineMeetingDetails","conferencingProvider","conferencingJoinUrl","responseEmailNotificationsEnabled","additionalResponseEmailNotificationsEnabled","notificationEmailIds","reminderOffsetsMinutes"],"properties":{"rallyId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"rallyShareCode":{"type":"string"},"rallyTitle":{"type":"string"},"rallyType":{"type":"string","enum":["group_poll","registration_sheet","booking_agent"]},"meetingFormat":{"type":"string","enum":["Virtual","Hybrid","In person"]},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["draft","active","confirmed","closed"],"description":"\"confirmed\" is a Group Poll with a confirmed time: voting is closed, and it becomes \"closed\" once the confirmed meeting has ended."},"createdAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"closedAt":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time","description":"When the rally became closed. Null until then -- including while a Group Poll is confirmed."},"confirmedSlot":{"type":["object","null"],"description":"A Group Poll's confirmed time. Stays set once the poll closes after its meeting, as the record of when the group met; null for other rally types, before a time is confirmed, and after a confirmation is canceled.","required":["slotId","startsAt","durationMinutes"],"properties":{"slotId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"startsAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"durationMinutes":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Null when the time was proposed without a duration."}}},"confirmedAt":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time","description":"When the current confirmedSlot was confirmed or last changed. Null whenever confirmedSlot is."},"description":{"type":"string"},"location":{"type":["string","null"]},"onlineMeetingDetails":{"type":["string","null"]},"conferencingProvider":{"type":"string","nullable":true,"enum":["zoom","google_meet","microsoft_teams","webex",null],"description":"Video conferencing provider attached to this rally, or null when none is."},"conferencingJoinUrl":{"type":"string","format":"uri","nullable":true,"description":"Meeting link for the rally itself, which is how a Group Poll carries one. Null for a Registration Sheet or Booking Agent, whose meetings belong to a session or an appointment, and null while a meeting is still being created."},"responseEmailNotificationsEnabled":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether the organizer is emailed a copy of each rally response."},"additionalResponseEmailNotificationsEnabled":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether notificationEmailIds also receive a copy."},"notificationEmailIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"description":"Up to 3 verified team notification email ids (see /v1/notification-emails) that also receive a copy of each response."},"reminderOffsetsMinutes":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer","enum":[60,120,1440,2880,10080]},"maxItems":2,"uniqueItems":true,"description":"When reminder emails go out, in minutes before each booked time, farthest first: 60, 120, 1440, 2880, or 10080 (1 hour, 2 hours, 1 day, 2 days, 1 week). An empty array means reminders are off. Registration Sheets and Booking Agents remind each attendee; a Group Poll reminds respondents who said yes or maybe once its time is confirmed."}}},"GroupPollRally":{"description":"A Group Poll -- Rally's common fields plus its own result-visibility toggles.","allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Rally"},{"type":"object","required":["hideParticipantNames","hideParticipantVotes"],"properties":{"hideParticipantNames":{"type":"boolean"},"hideParticipantVotes":{"type":"boolean"}}}]},"RegistrationSheetRally":{"description":"A Registration Sheet -- Rally's common fields plus its own capacity and sign-up settings.","allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Rally"},{"type":"object","required":["bookingCapacity","showAttendeeNamesToParticipants","allowMultipleBookings","maxBookingsPerAttendee","sessionNamesEnabled","slotCapacityOverridesEnabled"],"properties":{"bookingCapacity":{"type":"integer"},"showAttendeeNamesToParticipants":{"type":"boolean"},"allowMultipleBookings":{"type":"boolean"},"maxBookingsPerAttendee":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Set only when allowMultipleBookings is true."},"sessionNamesEnabled":{"type":"boolean","description":"When true, POST /v1/rallies/{id}/slots requires sessionName on every registration time."},"slotCapacityOverridesEnabled":{"type":"boolean","description":"When true, POST /v1/rallies/{id}/slots requires capacityOverride on every registration time, instead of every time sharing bookingCapacity."}}}]},"BookingAgentRally":{"description":"A Booking Agent -- Rally's common fields plus its own capacity, sign-up settings, and availability configuration.","allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Rally"},{"type":"object","required":["bookingCapacity","bookingAgent","customJoinSlug","joinUrl"],"properties":{"bookingCapacity":{"type":"integer"},"bookingAgent":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BookingAgentConfig","description":"Includes bookingLimit, which is how often one attendee may book -- a Booking Agent always allows multiple appointments, so it has no allowMultipleBookings/maxBookingsPerAttendee."},"customJoinSlug":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"An optional memorable suffix (3-30 lowercase letters, numbers, or hyphens) used in place of rallyShareCode in the participant join link, e.g. \"jasonmell\" for https://trooprally.com/join/jasonmell. Freed up for any other Booking Agent to claim once this one closes."},"joinUrl":{"type":"string","description":"The full participant join link -- uses customJoinSlug when set, otherwise rallyShareCode."}}}]},"BookingAgentConfig":{"type":"object","description":"A Booking Agent's recurring availability, booking window, and calendar-sync configuration.","required":["timezone","availability","durationMinutes","bufferMinutes","minimumLeadMinutes","rangeMode","rangeValue","rangeUnit","startDate","endDate","calendarId","conflictCheckEnabled","autoAddEnabled","bookingLimit"],"properties":{"timezone":{"type":"string","description":"IANA timezone name, e.g. America/New_York."},"availability":{"type":"array","description":"Exactly 7 entries, one per weekday (0=Sunday..6=Saturday), in order. Use an empty intervals array for days with no availability.","items":{"type":"object","required":["weekday","intervals"],"properties":{"weekday":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":6},"intervals":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","required":["start","end"],"properties":{"start":{"type":"string","description":"24-hour time, e.g. 09:00."},"end":{"type":"string","description":"24-hour time, e.g. 17:00."}}}}}}},"durationMinutes":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":1440},"bufferMinutes":{"type":"integer","enum":[0,5,10,15,20,25,30],"default":0,"description":"Minutes left free after each appointment before the next one can start; 0 for no buffer. Appointment times are durationMinutes + bufferMinutes apart, and an interval's last appointment needs only to fit, not its buffer. Optional on create."},"minimumLeadMinutes":{"type":"integer","enum":[0,15,30,60,120,180,240,480,1440,2880,4320,5760,7200,8640,10080],"default":0,"description":"How much notice an attendee must give, in minutes; 0 for none. Appointments starting within this long from now are not offered to attendees or bookable by them. The organizer is exempt: they can still book those times, including with this API. The values are 15 or 30 minutes, 1, 2, 3, 4 or 8 hours, 1 to 6 days, or 1 week. Optional on create."},"rangeMode":{"type":"string","enum":["rolling","unlimited","dates"],"description":"How far out appointments can be booked."},"rangeValue":{"type":["integer","null"],"minimum":1,"maximum":24,"description":"Required when rangeMode is rolling."},"rangeUnit":{"type":["string","null"],"enum":["weeks","months",null],"description":"Required when rangeMode is rolling."},"startDate":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date","description":"Required when rangeMode is dates."},"endDate":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date","description":"Required when rangeMode is dates."},"calendarId":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"uuid","description":"One of your connected calendars (see /v1/calendars). Omit or null to use your Settings-level default calendar."},"conflictCheckEnabled":{"type":"boolean","description":"Hide appointment times that conflict with events on the resolved calendar."},"autoAddEnabled":{"type":"boolean","description":"Automatically add booked appointments to the resolved calendar."},"bookingLimit":{"type":["object","null"],"description":"How often one attendee may book, or null for as often as they like. An attendee is their account when signed in and their email address otherwise, matched case-insensitively, so the same person counts once however they booked.","required":["count","window","value","unit"],"properties":{"count":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100,"description":"Appointments allowed per attendee within the window."},"window":{"type":"string","enum":["period","rolling","lifetime"],"description":"period: per rolling stretch of value x unit, counted backwards from the appointment being booked. rolling: during the agent's own rolling booking window, so it requires rangeMode rolling. lifetime: for the whole life of the Booking Agent."},"value":{"type":["integer","null"],"minimum":1,"maximum":52,"description":"Required when window is period; null otherwise."},"unit":{"type":["string","null"],"enum":["hours","days","weeks","months",null],"description":"Required when window is period; null otherwise."}}}}},"Slot":{"type":"object","description":"A time slot created by the organizer for a Group Poll or Registration Sheet rally. Booking Agent appointment times are not represented as slots -- see /v1/bookings. A rally can have up to 20 times on Free, or up to 100 on Plus and Pro.","required":["rallyId","rallyShareCode","rallyTitle","slotId","startsAt","endsAt","durationMinutes","sessionName","capacityOverride","addedAt"],"properties":{"rallyId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"rallyShareCode":{"type":"string"},"rallyTitle":{"type":"string"},"slotId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"startsAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"endsAt":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time"},"durationMinutes":{"type":["integer","null"]},"sessionName":{"type":["string","null"]},"capacityOverride":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"This registration time's own attendee limit, set only when its rally has slotCapacityOverridesEnabled."},"addedAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}},"NotificationEmail":{"type":"object","description":"A verified additional email address that receives copies of rally response notifications.","required":["notificationEmailId","email","verifiedAt","createdAt"],"properties":{"notificationEmailId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"email":{"type":"string"},"verifiedAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"createdAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}},"Calendar":{"type":"object","description":"A calendar connected for Booking Agent calendar sync.","required":["calendarId","provider","connectedEmail","name","readOnly","isDefault","connectedAt"],"properties":{"calendarId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"provider":{"type":["string","null"],"enum":["google","microsoft","apple",null]},"connectedEmail":{"type":["string","null"]},"name":{"type":"string"},"readOnly":{"type":"boolean"},"isDefault":{"type":"boolean"},"connectedAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}},"CustomField":{"type":"object","description":"A custom field collected from attendees on a registration sheet or booking agent. A rally can have as many custom fields as its organizer's plan allows (5 Free, 20 Plus, 50 Pro). For fieldType image, upload the image via POST /v1/rallies/{id}/custom-fields/{fieldId}/images first and use its returned customFieldResponse -- a plain string isn't accepted for an image field.","required":["customFieldId","rallyId","rallyShareCode","rallyTitle","prompt","fieldType","isRequired","position","createdAt"],"properties":{"customFieldId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"rallyId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"rallyShareCode":{"type":"string"},"rallyTitle":{"type":"string"},"prompt":{"type":"string"},"fieldType":{"type":"string","enum":["text","image"]},"isRequired":{"type":"boolean"},"position":{"type":"integer"},"createdAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}},"Booking":{"type":"object","description":"A booking agent appointment.","required":["bookingId","rallyId","rallyShareCode","rallyTitle","rallyType","attendeeName","attendeeEmail","slotStartsAt","slotEndsAt","sessionName","conferencingJoinUrl","status","createdAt"],"properties":{"bookingId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"rallyId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"rallyShareCode":{"type":"string"},"rallyTitle":{"type":"string"},"rallyType":{"type":"string"},"attendeeName":{"type":"string"},"attendeeEmail":{"type":["string","null"]},"slotStartsAt":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time"},"slotEndsAt":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time"},"sessionName":{"type":["string","null"]},"conferencingJoinUrl":{"type":"string","format":"uri","nullable":true,"description":"Meeting link for this appointment. Null when the rally has no provider, and null while the meeting is still being created."},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["confirmed","cancelled","rejected"]},"createdAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}},"Registration":{"type":"object","description":"A registration sheet sign-up for one of its pre-created times.","required":["registrationId","rallyId","rallyShareCode","rallyTitle","rallyType","attendeeName","attendeeEmail","slotStartsAt","slotEndsAt","sessionName","conferencingJoinUrl","status","createdAt"],"properties":{"registrationId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"rallyId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"rallyShareCode":{"type":"string"},"rallyTitle":{"type":"string"},"rallyType":{"type":"string"},"attendeeName":{"type":"string"},"attendeeEmail":{"type":["string","null"]},"slotStartsAt":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time"},"slotEndsAt":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time"},"sessionName":{"type":["string","null"]},"conferencingJoinUrl":{"type":"string","format":"uri","nullable":true,"description":"Meeting link for the session this registration is for, shared by everyone registered for it. Null when the rally has no provider."},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["confirmed","cancelled","rejected"]},"createdAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}},"PollResponse":{"type":"object","description":"Poll response for a group poll.","required":["rallyId","rallyShareCode","rallyTitle","participantId","respondentName","respondentEmail"],"properties":{"rallyId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"rallyShareCode":{"type":"string"},"rallyTitle":{"type":"string"},"participantId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"respondentName":{"type":"string"},"respondentEmail":{"type":["string","null"]}}},"Error":{"type":"object","required":["error","requestId"],"properties":{"error":{"type":"string"},"requestId":{"type":"string"}}}},"responses":{"Unauthorized":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"That API key is invalid or has been revoked.","requestId":"6f2a8c1e-9d4b-4a7c-8e1f-3b5d7a9c2e4f"}}}},"Forbidden":{"description":"The API key is valid, but is missing the scope this route requires, or the account isn't on a Pro plan.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"This API key doesn't have the \"rallies:write\" scope.","requestId":"1c4e7a2f-8b3d-4c9e-9f6a-2d8b5e1c4a7f"}}}},"NotFound":{"description":"The resource doesn't exist, isn't yours, or otherwise isn't accessible.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"That rally was not found.","requestId":"9a3f6c2e-1d8b-4e7a-8c5f-4b9d2e7a1c6f"}}}},"BadRequest":{"description":"The request is malformed or invalid.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"meetingFormat must be one of Virtual, Hybrid, In person.","requestId":"4e8a1c7f-2b9d-4a6e-9c3f-7d1b5a8e2c9f"}}}},"TooManyRequests":{"description":"The API key has exceeded its rate limit. Back off and retry after the number of seconds in the Retry-After header. On the Group Poll confirmation routes, a 429 can also mean the poll has reached its limit of 3 emailed actions in 24 hours; Retry-After then gives the wait, and notifyRespondents: false saves without emailing.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"Too many requests. Please slow down and try again shortly.","requestId":"2d7b4e9a-6c1f-4d8b-9a5e-3f7c2b8d1e6a"}}}}},"parameters":{"Cursor":{"name":"cursor","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","example":"eyJjcmVhdGVkQXQiOiIyMDI2LTA5LTA4VDE1OjA0OjAwWiIsImlkIjoiN2Y5YzJhYjAtM2UyMS00YjhhLTlmNmQtMWMyZTNhNGI1YzZkIn0"},"description":"Pass the nextCursor from a previous page's response to fetch the next one. Omit for the first page."}}},"paths":{"/v1/rallies":{"get":{"summary":"List rallies","description":"Every rally type together, but only fields common to all of them (see the Rally schema) -- use rallyType plus GET /v1/rallies/group-polls/{id}, /v1/rallies/registration-sheets/{id}, or /v1/rallies/booking-agents/{id} for a rally's type-specific fields. Creation is split the same way: POST to /v1/rallies/group-polls, /v1/rallies/registration-sheets, or /v1/rallies/booking-agents.","security":[{"apiKeyAuth":[]}],"x-required-scopes":["rallies:read"],"parameters":[{"name":"status","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["draft","active","confirmed","closed"]}},{"name":"rallyType","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["group_poll","registration_sheet","booking_agent"]},"description":"Narrow the list to one rally type."},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Cursor"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Rallies, newest first.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","nextCursor"],"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Rally"}},"nextCursor":{"type":["string","null"],"description":"Pass as ?cursor= to fetch the next page; null when there are no more results."}}},"example":{"data":[{"rallyId":"7f9c2ab0-3e21-4b8a-9f6d-1c2e3a4b5c6d","rallyShareCode":"k3f9mQ2xR7pL8vN1wZ4yTgHs","rallyTitle":"Board Meeting","rallyType":"group_poll","meetingFormat":"Virtual","status":"active","createdAt":"2026-09-08T15:04:00Z","closedAt":null,"confirmedSlot":null,"confirmedAt":null,"description":"Quarterly board meeting to review budget and upcoming events.","location":null,"onlineMeetingDetails":"https://meet.example.com/board-q3","conferencingProvider":"zoom","conferencingJoinUrl":"https://zoom.us/j/9876543210","responseEmailNotificationsEnabled":true,"additionalResponseEmailNotificationsEnabled":false,"notificationEmailIds":[],"reminderOffsetsMinutes":[]},{"rallyId":"3c1e6f8a-9b2d-4c7e-8a1f-5d6e7f8a9b0c","rallyShareCode":"p8qR2vN5xK1mZ7wT3yL9gHsF","rallyTitle":"Volunteer Orientation","rallyType":"registration_sheet","meetingFormat":"In person","status":"closed","createdAt":"2026-09-01T18:30:00Z","closedAt":"2026-09-07T12:00:00Z","confirmedSlot":null,"confirmedAt":null,"description":"","location":"Community Center, Room B","onlineMeetingDetails":null,"conferencingProvider":"zoom","conferencingJoinUrl":null,"responseEmailNotificationsEnabled":true,"additionalResponseEmailNotificationsEnabled":false,"notificationEmailIds":[],"reminderOffsetsMinutes":[1440]}],"nextCursor":"eyJjcmVhdGVkQXQiOiIyMDI2LTA5LTAxVDE4OjMwOjAwWiIsImlkIjoiM2MxZTZmOGEtOWIyZC00YzdlLThhMWYtNWQ2ZTdmOGE5YjBjIn0"}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/BadRequest"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"}}}},"/v1/rallies/group-polls":{"post":{"summary":"Create a Group Poll","security":[{"apiKeyAuth":[]}],"x-required-scopes":["rallies:write"],"parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","maxLength":255},"description":"Reuse the same key to safely retry a create request -- replaying it with the same request body returns the original rally instead of creating a second one; reusing it with a different body is rejected with 422. Retained for 24 hours after first use; reusing a key after that starts a fresh request instead of replaying the original."}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["title","meetingFormat"],"properties":{"title":{"type":"string","maxLength":160},"meetingFormat":{"type":"string","enum":["Virtual","Hybrid","In person"]},"description":{"type":"string"},"location":{"type":"string"},"onlineMeetingDetails":{"type":"string"},"hideParticipantNames":{"type":"boolean","default":false},"hideParticipantVotes":{"type":"boolean","default":false},"responseEmailNotificationsEnabled":{"type":"boolean","default":true,"description":"Whether you're emailed a copy of each rally response."},"additionalResponseEmailNotificationsEnabled":{"type":"boolean","default":false,"description":"Whether notificationEmailIds also receive a copy."},"notificationEmailIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"maxItems":3,"description":"Up to 3 verified team notification email ids from /v1/notification-emails."}}},"example":{"title":"Board Meeting","meetingFormat":"Virtual","description":"Quarterly board meeting to review budget and upcoming events.","onlineMeetingDetails":"https://meet.example.com/board-q3","conferencingProvider":null,"conferencingJoinUrl":null,"responseEmailNotificationsEnabled":true}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The created rally.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GroupPollRally"},"example":{"rallyId":"7f9c2ab0-3e21-4b8a-9f6d-1c2e3a4b5c6d","rallyShareCode":"k3f9mQ2xR7pL8vN1wZ4yTgHs","rallyTitle":"Board Meeting","rallyType":"group_poll","meetingFormat":"Virtual","status":"active","createdAt":"2026-09-08T15:04:00Z","closedAt":null,"confirmedSlot":null,"confirmedAt":null,"description":"Quarterly board meeting to review budget and upcoming events.","location":null,"onlineMeetingDetails":"https://meet.example.com/board-q3","conferencingProvider":"zoom","conferencingJoinUrl":"https://zoom.us/j/9876543210","responseEmailNotificationsEnabled":true,"additionalResponseEmailNotificationsEnabled":false,"notificationEmailIds":[],"reminderOffsetsMinutes":[],"hideParticipantNames":false,"hideParticipantVotes":false}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/BadRequest"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"422":{"description":"Idempotency-Key was already used with a different request body.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"This Idempotency-Key was already used with a different request body.","requestId":"8b3e6a1c-4f9d-4c7e-9a2f-1d6b8e3a5c9f"}}}},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"}}}},"/v1/rallies/group-polls/{id}":{"get":{"summary":"Get a Group Poll","security":[{"apiKeyAuth":[]}],"x-required-scopes":["rallies:read"],"parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"The rally.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GroupPollRally"}}}},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"404":{"description":"Not found, not yours, or not a Group Poll.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"}}}},"/v1/rallies/group-polls/{id}/confirmation":{"post":{"summary":"Confirm a Group Poll's time","description":"Confirms one of the poll's own times that hasn't started yet. Voting closes and the poll's status becomes \"confirmed\". Works on an open poll or one that has already ended. Everyone who responded is emailed the time unless notifyRespondents is false. At most 3 confirmations, changes, or cancellations that email respondents are allowed per poll in any 24 hours; past that the request is refused with 429 and Retry-After. Requests with notifyRespondents: false are never limited. The time is also added to the organizer's default calendar (Settings → Integrations) unless addToCalendar is false; nothing is added if they have no writable default calendar. Only the organizer's calendar gets an event -- respondents aren't invited through it.","security":[{"apiKeyAuth":[]}],"x-required-scopes":["rallies:write"],"parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}},{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","maxLength":255},"description":"Reuse the same key to safely retry a confirmation -- replaying it with the same request body returns the original result instead of acting twice; reusing it with a different body is rejected with 422. Retained for 24 hours after first use."}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["slotId"],"properties":{"slotId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"One of this poll's times (see GET /v1/slots), not yet started."},"notifyRespondents":{"type":"boolean","default":true,"description":"Email everyone who responded. Defaults to true."},"addToCalendar":{"type":"boolean","default":true,"description":"Add the confirmed time to the organizer's default calendar. Defaults to true. Ignored when the organizer has no writable default calendar. A later change or cancellation moves or removes the event, following this choice."},"reminderOffsetsMinutes":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer","enum":[60,120,1440,2880,10080]},"maxItems":2,"uniqueItems":true,"description":"When to email respondents who said yes or maybe a reminder, in minutes before the meeting: up to two of 60, 120, 1440, 2880, 10080, or [] for none. Left out, the poll keeps reminders it already has, or reminds 1 day before if it has none."}}},"example":{"slotId":"3c1d9e7a-5b2f-4a8c-9d6e-1f4b7a2c8e5d","notifyRespondents":true,"addToCalendar":true}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The Group Poll as it now stands.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GroupPollRally"},"example":{"rallyId":"7f9c2ab0-3e21-4b8a-9f6d-1c2e3a4b5c6d","rallyShareCode":"k3f9mQ2xR7pL8vN1wZ4yTgHs","rallyTitle":"Board Meeting","rallyType":"group_poll","meetingFormat":"Virtual","status":"confirmed","createdAt":"2026-09-08T15:04:00Z","closedAt":null,"confirmedSlot":{"slotId":"3c1d9e7a-5b2f-4a8c-9d6e-1f4b7a2c8e5d","startsAt":"2026-09-22T17:00:00Z","durationMinutes":60},"confirmedAt":"2026-09-15T14:30:00Z","description":"Quarterly board meeting to review budget and upcoming events.","location":null,"onlineMeetingDetails":"https://meet.example.com/board-q3","conferencingProvider":"zoom","conferencingJoinUrl":"https://zoom.us/j/9876543210","responseEmailNotificationsEnabled":true,"additionalResponseEmailNotificationsEnabled":false,"notificationEmailIds":[],"reminderOffsetsMinutes":[1440],"hideParticipantNames":false,"hideParticipantVotes":false}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/BadRequest"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"404":{"description":"Not found, not yours, or not a Group Poll.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"That rally was not found.","requestId":"8b3e6a1c-4f9d-4c7e-9a2f-1d6b8e3a5c9f"}}}},"409":{"description":"The poll already has a confirmed time (use PUT to change it), or the chosen time is already confirmed.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"This Group Poll already has a confirmed time. Use PUT to change it.","requestId":"8b3e6a1c-4f9d-4c7e-9a2f-1d6b8e3a5c9f"}}}},"422":{"description":"Idempotency-Key was already used with a different request body.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"This Idempotency-Key was already used with a different request body.","requestId":"8b3e6a1c-4f9d-4c7e-9a2f-1d6b8e3a5c9f"}}}},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"}}},"put":{"summary":"Change a Group Poll's confirmed time","description":"Moves the confirmation to another of the poll's times that hasn't started yet. The note replaces the previous one. Everyone who responded is emailed the change unless notifyRespondents is false. At most 3 confirmations, changes, or cancellations that email respondents are allowed per poll in any 24 hours; past that the request is refused with 429 and Retry-After. Requests with notifyRespondents: false are never limited. If the time was added to the organizer's calendar, the event moves to the new time. addToCalendar can't be set here; the choice made when confirming applies.","security":[{"apiKeyAuth":[]}],"x-required-scopes":["rallies:write"],"parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}},{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","maxLength":255},"description":"Reuse the same key to safely retry a change -- replaying it with the same request body returns the original result instead of acting twice; reusing it with a different body is rejected with 422. Retained for 24 hours after first use."}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["slotId"],"properties":{"slotId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"Another of this poll's times, not yet started."},"notifyRespondents":{"type":"boolean","default":true,"description":"Email everyone who responded. Defaults to true."},"reminderOffsetsMinutes":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer","enum":[60,120,1440,2880,10080]},"maxItems":2,"uniqueItems":true,"description":"When to email respondents who said yes or maybe a reminder, in minutes before the new time: up to two of 60, 120, 1440, 2880, 10080, or [] for none. Left out, the poll keeps the reminders it has."}}},"example":{"slotId":"9e2b6f1a-7c4d-4e8b-a3f5-2d9c6b1e4a7f","notifyRespondents":true}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The Group Poll as it now stands.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GroupPollRally"},"example":{"rallyId":"7f9c2ab0-3e21-4b8a-9f6d-1c2e3a4b5c6d","rallyShareCode":"k3f9mQ2xR7pL8vN1wZ4yTgHs","rallyTitle":"Board Meeting","rallyType":"group_poll","meetingFormat":"Virtual","status":"confirmed","createdAt":"2026-09-08T15:04:00Z","closedAt":null,"confirmedSlot":{"slotId":"9e2b6f1a-7c4d-4e8b-a3f5-2d9c6b1e4a7f","startsAt":"2026-09-24T17:00:00Z","durationMinutes":60},"confirmedAt":"2026-09-16T09:10:00Z","description":"Quarterly board meeting to review budget and upcoming events.","location":null,"onlineMeetingDetails":"https://meet.example.com/board-q3","conferencingProvider":"zoom","conferencingJoinUrl":"https://zoom.us/j/9876543210","responseEmailNotificationsEnabled":true,"additionalResponseEmailNotificationsEnabled":false,"notificationEmailIds":[],"reminderOffsetsMinutes":[1440],"hideParticipantNames":false,"hideParticipantVotes":false}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/BadRequest"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"404":{"description":"Not found, not yours, or not a Group Poll.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"That rally was not found.","requestId":"8b3e6a1c-4f9d-4c7e-9a2f-1d6b8e3a5c9f"}}}},"409":{"description":"The poll doesn't have a confirmed time, or slotId is already the confirmed time.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"This Group Poll doesn't have a confirmed time.","requestId":"8b3e6a1c-4f9d-4c7e-9a2f-1d6b8e3a5c9f"}}}},"422":{"description":"Idempotency-Key was already used with a different request body.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"This Idempotency-Key was already used with a different request body.","requestId":"8b3e6a1c-4f9d-4c7e-9a2f-1d6b8e3a5c9f"}}}},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"}}},"delete":{"summary":"Cancel a Group Poll's confirmed time","description":"Cancels the confirmation. The poll becomes \"closed\" and its participant link stops working; a time can still be confirmed again later. A request body is optional. Everyone who responded is emailed the cancellation unless notifyRespondents is false. At most 3 confirmations, changes, or cancellations that email respondents are allowed per poll in any 24 hours; past that the request is refused with 429 and Retry-After. Requests with notifyRespondents: false are never limited. If the time was added to the organizer's calendar, the event is removed. addToCalendar can't be set here.","security":[{"apiKeyAuth":[]}],"x-required-scopes":["rallies:write"],"parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}},{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","maxLength":255},"description":"Reuse the same key to safely retry a cancellation -- replaying it with the same request body returns the original result instead of acting twice; reusing it with a different body is rejected with 422. Retained for 24 hours after first use."}],"requestBody":{"required":false,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"notifyRespondents":{"type":"boolean","default":true,"description":"Email everyone who responded. Defaults to true."}}},"example":{"notifyRespondents":true}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The Group Poll as it now stands.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GroupPollRally"},"example":{"rallyId":"7f9c2ab0-3e21-4b8a-9f6d-1c2e3a4b5c6d","rallyShareCode":"k3f9mQ2xR7pL8vN1wZ4yTgHs","rallyTitle":"Board Meeting","rallyType":"group_poll","meetingFormat":"Virtual","status":"closed","createdAt":"2026-09-08T15:04:00Z","closedAt":"2026-09-16T09:10:00Z","confirmedSlot":null,"confirmedAt":null,"description":"Quarterly board meeting to review budget and upcoming events.","location":null,"onlineMeetingDetails":"https://meet.example.com/board-q3","conferencingProvider":"zoom","conferencingJoinUrl":"https://zoom.us/j/9876543210","responseEmailNotificationsEnabled":true,"additionalResponseEmailNotificationsEnabled":false,"notificationEmailIds":[],"reminderOffsetsMinutes":[],"hideParticipantNames":false,"hideParticipantVotes":false}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/BadRequest"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"404":{"description":"Not found, not yours, or not a Group Poll.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"That rally was not found.","requestId":"8b3e6a1c-4f9d-4c7e-9a2f-1d6b8e3a5c9f"}}}},"409":{"description":"The poll doesn't have a confirmed time.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"This Group Poll doesn't have a confirmed time.","requestId":"8b3e6a1c-4f9d-4c7e-9a2f-1d6b8e3a5c9f"}}}},"422":{"description":"Idempotency-Key was already used with a different request body.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"This Idempotency-Key was already used with a different request body.","requestId":"8b3e6a1c-4f9d-4c7e-9a2f-1d6b8e3a5c9f"}}}},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"}}}},"/v1/rallies/registration-sheets":{"post":{"summary":"Create a Registration Sheet","security":[{"apiKeyAuth":[]}],"x-required-scopes":["rallies:write"],"parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","maxLength":255},"description":"Reuse the same key to safely retry a create request -- replaying it with the same request body returns the original rally instead of creating a second one; reusing it with a different body is rejected with 422. Retained for 24 hours after first use; reusing a key after that starts a fresh request instead of replaying the original."}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["title","meetingFormat","bookingCapacity"],"properties":{"title":{"type":"string","maxLength":160},"meetingFormat":{"type":"string","enum":["Virtual","Hybrid","In person"]},"bookingCapacity":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":20},"description":{"type":"string"},"location":{"type":"string"},"onlineMeetingDetails":{"type":"string"},"showAttendeeNamesToParticipants":{"type":"boolean","default":false},"allowMultipleBookings":{"type":"boolean","default":false},"maxBookingsPerAttendee":{"type":"integer","minimum":2,"maximum":20,"description":"Required when allowMultipleBookings is true."},"sessionNamesEnabled":{"type":"boolean","default":false,"description":"Require a label (session name) on every registration time added via POST /v1/rallies/{id}/slots."},"slotCapacityOverridesEnabled":{"type":"boolean","default":false,"description":"Require an individual attendee limit (capacityOverride) on every registration time added via POST /v1/rallies/{id}/slots, instead of every time sharing bookingCapacity."},"responseEmailNotificationsEnabled":{"type":"boolean","default":true,"description":"Whether you're emailed a copy of each rally response."},"additionalResponseEmailNotificationsEnabled":{"type":"boolean","default":false,"description":"Whether notificationEmailIds also receive a copy."},"notificationEmailIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"maxItems":3,"description":"Up to 3 verified team notification email ids from /v1/notification-emails."},"reminderOffsetsMinutes":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer","enum":[60,120,1440,2880,10080]},"maxItems":2,"uniqueItems":true,"default":[1440],"description":"When to email each attendee a reminder, in minutes before their time: up to two of 60, 120, 1440, 2880, 10080. Defaults to [1440], 1 day before. Send [] to turn reminders off. Anything else returns 400 naming the allowed values."}}},"example":{"title":"Volunteer Orientation","meetingFormat":"In person","bookingCapacity":12,"location":"Community Center, Room B","sessionNamesEnabled":true,"responseEmailNotificationsEnabled":true}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The created rally.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RegistrationSheetRally"},"example":{"rallyId":"3c1e6f8a-9b2d-4c7e-8a1f-5d6e7f8a9b0c","rallyShareCode":"p8qR2vN5xK1mZ7wT3yL9gHsF","rallyTitle":"Volunteer Orientation","rallyType":"registration_sheet","meetingFormat":"In person","status":"active","createdAt":"2026-09-08T15:10:00Z","closedAt":null,"confirmedSlot":null,"confirmedAt":null,"description":"","location":"Community Center, Room B","onlineMeetingDetails":null,"conferencingProvider":"zoom","conferencingJoinUrl":null,"responseEmailNotificationsEnabled":true,"additionalResponseEmailNotificationsEnabled":false,"notificationEmailIds":[],"reminderOffsetsMinutes":[1440],"bookingCapacity":12,"showAttendeeNamesToParticipants":false,"allowMultipleBookings":false,"maxBookingsPerAttendee":null,"sessionNamesEnabled":true,"slotCapacityOverridesEnabled":false}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/BadRequest"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"422":{"description":"Idempotency-Key was already used with a different request body.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"This Idempotency-Key was already used with a different request body.","requestId":"8b3e6a1c-4f9d-4c7e-9a2f-1d6b8e3a5c9f"}}}},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"}}}},"/v1/rallies/registration-sheets/{id}":{"get":{"summary":"Get a Registration Sheet","security":[{"apiKeyAuth":[]}],"x-required-scopes":["rallies:read"],"parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"The rally.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RegistrationSheetRally"}}}},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"404":{"description":"Not found, not yours, or not a Registration Sheet.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"}}}},"/v1/rallies/booking-agents":{"post":{"summary":"Create a Booking Agent","security":[{"apiKeyAuth":[]}],"x-required-scopes":["rallies:write"],"parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","maxLength":255},"description":"Reuse the same key to safely retry a create request -- replaying it with the same request body returns the original rally instead of creating a second one; reusing it with a different body is rejected with 422. Retained for 24 hours after first use; reusing a key after that starts a fresh request instead of replaying the original."}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["title","meetingFormat","bookingCapacity","bookingAgent"],"properties":{"title":{"type":"string","maxLength":160},"meetingFormat":{"type":"string","enum":["Virtual","Hybrid","In person"]},"bookingCapacity":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":20},"description":{"type":"string"},"location":{"type":"string"},"onlineMeetingDetails":{"type":"string"},"bookingAgent":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BookingAgentConfig"}],"description":"Set bufferMinutes to leave time between appointments, minimumLeadMinutes to require notice before a booking, and bookingLimit to cap how often one attendee may book; leave any of them out for none. A Booking Agent always allows multiple appointments, so there is no allowMultipleBookings/maxBookingsPerAttendee to send."},"customJoinSlug":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-z0-9](?:[a-z0-9-]{1,28}[a-z0-9])?$","description":"An optional memorable suffix (3-30 lowercase letters, numbers, or hyphens) for the participant join link, e.g. \"jasonmell\" for https://trooprally.com/join/jasonmell, used in place of the auto-generated rallyShareCode. Freed up for any other Booking Agent to claim once this one closes. Returns 409 if already taken."},"responseEmailNotificationsEnabled":{"type":"boolean","default":true,"description":"Whether you're emailed a copy of each rally response."},"additionalResponseEmailNotificationsEnabled":{"type":"boolean","default":false,"description":"Whether notificationEmailIds also receive a copy."},"notificationEmailIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"maxItems":3,"description":"Up to 3 verified team notification email ids from /v1/notification-emails."},"reminderOffsetsMinutes":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer","enum":[60,120,1440,2880,10080]},"maxItems":2,"uniqueItems":true,"default":[1440],"description":"When to email each attendee a reminder, in minutes before their time: up to two of 60, 120, 1440, 2880, 10080. Defaults to [1440], 1 day before. Send [] to turn reminders off. Anything else returns 400 naming the allowed values."}}},"example":{"title":"Office Hours","meetingFormat":"Virtual","bookingCapacity":1,"onlineMeetingDetails":"https://meet.example.com/office-hours","conferencingProvider":null,"conferencingJoinUrl":null,"customJoinSlug":"office-hours","bookingAgent":{"timezone":"America/New_York","durationMinutes":30,"bufferMinutes":10,"minimumLeadMinutes":120,"rangeMode":"rolling","rangeValue":2,"rangeUnit":"weeks","availability":[{"weekday":0,"intervals":[]},{"weekday":1,"intervals":[{"start":"09:00","end":"12:00"}]},{"weekday":2,"intervals":[{"start":"09:00","end":"12:00"}]},{"weekday":3,"intervals":[{"start":"09:00","end":"12:00"}]},{"weekday":4,"intervals":[{"start":"09:00","end":"12:00"}]},{"weekday":5,"intervals":[]},{"weekday":6,"intervals":[]}],"conflictCheckEnabled":true,"autoAddEnabled":true,"bookingLimit":{"count":2,"window":"period","value":7,"unit":"days"}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The created rally.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BookingAgentRally"},"example":{"rallyId":"a4d7c2e9-1f6b-4d8a-9c3e-7b2a5f8d1c4e","rallyShareCode":"m2K9pQ4xN7vR1zW5yT8gLsHf","rallyTitle":"Office Hours","rallyType":"booking_agent","meetingFormat":"Virtual","status":"active","